msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:53
msgid "Select the playbook or run you want to add conditions to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:54
msgid "Select the **Outline** tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:55
msgid "Under **Tasks**, identify a task you want to make conditional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks.rst:56
msgid ""
"From the **More** |more-icon-vertical| icon next to the task, select "
"**Add condition**."
